WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.710
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.050
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.050
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.410
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.920
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:32.530
Chaos-

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:36.200
Wait a second. What are you going to do about this boy?

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:38.660
I don't care what happens to him.

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:42.990
Please help me save Sonic.

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:45.500
Sonic is my dear friend.

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:46.910
Please!

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:50.920
Please, Shadow.

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:06.160
Episode 36

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:06.160
A Threat from Outer Space

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:11.840
Day 2

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:15.570
We have a follow-up report on the Prison Island explosion.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:21.700
According to a formal announcement by GUN, there were no casualties.

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:26.910
I told you Chris was okay.

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:30.420
But if he took Chris...

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:33.250
I don't have peace of mind.

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:35.210
I know.

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:38.170
He better not lay a finger on Chris.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:05.790
Sonic the Hedgehog is currently in hiding-

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:13.830
I guess I'll get going.

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:15.380
Why don't you stay here and hide?

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:16.710
No way.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:21.090
It wasn't even worth mentioning.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:23.720
Let's also go and rescue Chris!

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:29.020
They most likely took Chris to Dr. Eggman's secret base.

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:31.190
We have to find out where it's located.

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:32.560
How do we do that?

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:35.860
We have to split up and search for leads.

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.730
We'll look for him too.

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:44.910
I'm going to get her!

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:48.450
That damn female bat!

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.500
You punk!

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:55.710
A girl?

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:14.230
What's that?

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.660
This is...

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:46.090
If all I can see is Earth...

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:49.390
Where am I? Am I actually in outer space?

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:51.930
Space Colony ARK.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.020
What's that?

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:59.520
It's a space colony constructed by the great scientist Professor Gerald.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:04.740
Space colony? You must be kidding!

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:09.070
I don't believe it!

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:10.910
I'm in outer space!

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:14.000
Am I the first child ever to come to outer space?

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:15.080
No.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:18.080
There was someone before me?

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:23.460
By the way, are you sure you're not Sonic's brother?

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:26.130
If not, are you in the same clan?

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.070
Maria.

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:51.700
After them! Don't let any of the staff escape!

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:06.130
Please, Shadow. Someday, as my replacement...

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:07.050
Maria!

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.800
For everyone living on that planet...

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:23.480
Adios, Shadow the Hedgehog.

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:34.910
I know, Maria. I promise.

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:39.210
I'll get revenge on everyone living on this planet!

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.750
Dr. Eggman.

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:46.630
We finished putting the Chaos Emeralds in place.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:52.850
Okay... Do this... And this...

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.220
Okay...

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:59.770
What's the name of this cannon that your grandfather left you?

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:01.400
Eclipse Cannon!

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:05.940
With the power of the Chaos Emeralds, it's the ultimate weapon that can even destroy planets.

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:08.240
Can it really destroy planets?

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:09.950
I think it's all hype.

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:11.530
Did you say something?

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:13.450
Not at all!

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:18.450
Does this thing actually work?

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:19.830
Just wait and see.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:22.370
I'll soon give you an interesting show.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:34.350
I called Chris's house, but he wasn't in.

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:37.680
Maybe he's searching for Sonic.

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:41.020
Wasn't that...

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:42.350
Sonic!

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:44.400
What are you doing?

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:45.060
Look.

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:51.700
Look at that!

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:54.320
The sky is red.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:59.410
It's a beautiful sunset, young lady.

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:03.850
Day 2

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.170
This is the place.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:13.050
If he had a normal life, he'd be spending time with his grandchildren right now.

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:18.010
But since he was involved in Project Shadow, he had to change his name and move from place to place.

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:19.930
Bon appetit.

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:26.520
Excuse me, is there a Mr. Schmitz here?

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:30.230
You mean that old man? He's over there.

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.780
Thanks.

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.450
It's still warm. Let's wait awhile.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:39.580
Sure.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:52.210
People around the world, listen!

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:55.880
My name is Dr. Eggman.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:59.510
He's always getting carried away.

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:01.020
Look up at the sky.

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:02.600
The sky?

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:07.270
I'm broadcasting live from outer space.

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:16.570
Witness the power of the Eggman Empire!

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:18.660
What's he going to do?

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:26.120
It's showtime!

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:35.400
Oh no! Half of the moon is gone!

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:38.360
How did he get that much energy?

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:39.820
It's the Chaos Emeralds!

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:44.080
This was the reason why Eggman's gang was looking for the Chaos Emeralds!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:50.120
What happened? What's this?

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:54.040
He wasn't kidding when he said that it's an ultimate weapon that can destroy planets.

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.890
Did you see the power of the Eclipse Cannon?

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:09.940
If you don't want Earth to meet the same fate, surrender within 24 hours!

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:14.480
How dare Eggman get so cocky!

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:36.690
Day 3

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:49.520
This is the final time that mankind will see the sunrise.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:50.680
What?

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:05.280
Why did you save me?

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:18.250
Shadow, you sure like looking at Earth.

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:25.390
The professor says that his research is for the people who live there.

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:30.430
That his purpose in life is to use the power of science to make everyone happy.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.020
Shadow.

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:39.230
Maria, I can't figure out why I was born and what I'm supposed to do.

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:42.780
Will I find the answer if I go to that planet someday?

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.370
Maria...

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:51.160
What are you daydreaming about?

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:52.330
Good morning.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:53.960
Good morning.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:57.250
Can't you say &quot;Good morning?&quot;

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:01.340
Oh my, did I offend you?

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:07.800
He's so defiant.

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:17.480
Hang on, Chris.

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:20.690
Even if you're in space, we'll rescue you.

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:24.950
If we have one more Chaos Emerald, the X-Tornado can make it there.

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:27.200
But Eggman has the rest.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:29.120
Yeah. Therefore...

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:33.160
Is that a replica?

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:38.000
It's impossible to make a perfect copy, but I think we can make it as long as it has the same wavelength.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:40.630
Okay, let's give it a try!

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:52.390
He didn't come home after all.

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:59.270
I found Sonic!

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:01.060
Where? Stop!

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.110
That way!

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:06.280
All right!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:15.250
Sonic, stop!

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:28.680
We all knew this would be the outcome.

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:32.180
What?

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:35.520
You idiots! I'm not Sonic!

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:42.440
Sonic?

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:44.190
Long time no see, Knuckles.

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:45.860
I'll be the one to defeat them.

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.400
You stay out of it!

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:49.530
Hey now!

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:55.790
It looks like you're better at assessing the situation than before.

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:09.300
Damn! There's no end to them!

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:18.270
Sonic! Knuckles! Now's your chance!

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:23.250
Day 3

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.360
What are your demands, Dr. Eggman?

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:29.570
It's good that you understand the situation, Mr. President.

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:32.660
Since you're a busy man, I'll keep it short.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:35.620
My demand is very simple and clear.

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:40.750
Submit to the Eggman Empire! Or else...

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:42.370
Or else...

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:46.170
You will all die.

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:50.340
What's your decision?

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:52.880
I can't!

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:54.640
What?

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:56.930
Please, Eggman! Don't do it!

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:57.760
I implore you!

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:03.480
The head of a nation is begging for mercy? How pathetic!

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.060
Fine. I'll give you half a day to think about it.

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:07.820
I'll be waiting for a favorable answer.

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:10.440
I was begging for mercy.

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:14.700
I'm far from being a hero.

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.370
That's not true.

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:21.910
Protecting your people was more important than your pride. That's admirable.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.000
Really?

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:27.170
Yes. Because I, The Glory of Man, say so.

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:33.570
Day 3

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:35.300
A rocket?

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:36.800
Most likely.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:42.480
Anyway, is it true that the female bat was with Eggman's gang?

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:43.440
Yeah.

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:45.020
I'll get you, lady!

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:47.060
There's a pyramid ahead.

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:58.240
Make sure you don't get lost.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.620
Yes, Amy.

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:01.870
Be careful!

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:06.250
Sonic's team is entering Eggman's base.

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:08.290
Please give me my orders.

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:22.310
It's no good.

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:26.900
There's a keyhole. That means there's a key somewhere.

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:30.320
Why are you looking at me?

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:31.980
You're a treasure hunter, right?

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.650
We're counting on you to find the key.

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:36.400
Are you ordering me around?

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:41.700
If you can't find it, you should drop your title as a treasure hunter.

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:45.580
You gave that title to yourself anyway.

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:49.460
Is there a test to become a real treasure hunter?

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:52.170
Fine!

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:56.880
How dare they say those things!

00:17:57.550 --> 00:18:00.260
Hey Knuckles! Are you running errands for someone?

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:04.430
I'll pretend I didn't hear that.

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:05.730
Get lost!

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:07.390
That's what I'm supposed to say!

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:09.270
I'll turn you in for trespassing!

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:11.110
Why you!

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:14.780
No, I don't fight weaklings.

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:18.910
He makes me so angry!

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.740
However...

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:23.030
Come forth, Egg Golem!

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:34.460
Knuckles is back!

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:35.800
Oh geez.

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:42.350
We tell him to find a key, but he brings back a monster!

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:43.890
Golem Punch!

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:49.690
Get the door open by any means necessary, right?

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:50.940
I guess.

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:00.280
Golem Screw!

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:06.040
I'll deal with him.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:11.920
Golem Headbutt!

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:19.880
How's that? I'll bet that hurt!

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:24.510
That was nothing.

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:26.680
It's no fun unless they try.

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:35.690
Here's the same attack as last time!

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:38.190
Take this!

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:45.910
That's about it.

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:47.200
Yeah.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:49.950
We're not done! Go!

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.290
You still want to fight?

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:57.460
Shut up! Look at this!

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:02.720
That's cheating!

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:04.260
Whatever!

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:11.520
That's cheating!

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:13.190
The feeling's mutual.

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:16.560
Let's see...

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:25.450
No! Stop it!

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.750
Stop!

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:36.670
You idiots!

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:38.630
No!

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:50.850
You idiots!

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:54.810
Are you all right, Miss?

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:56.860
Yes.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:06.030
It's over there.

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:11.540
Okay, I'm going to land.

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:25.800
Sonic! I reconfigured the X-Tornado.

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:27.430
Now we can go to outer space!

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:33.220
But there's no room for all of us.

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:35.440
Only four of us can go.

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:39.400
If we're rescuing and returning with Chris, there are actually only three seats.

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:40.730
You're right.

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:43.230
Then let's take this instead.

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:46.700
That's a good idea.

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:47.160
Yeah!

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:50.070
After all the trouble I went through to reconfigure it...

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:52.290
But who will take care of Cream and Cheese?

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:54.500
If it's okay with you, I'll watch them.

00:21:54.870 --> 00:21:56.160
Thank you.

00:21:56.660 --> 00:21:57.920
No problem.

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:00.590
Okay, let's go!

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:03.630
10.

00:22:03.630 --> 00:22:04.550
9.

00:22:04.550 --> 00:22:05.470
8.

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:06.510
7.

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:07.510
6.

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:08.470
5.

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:09.470
4.

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:10.510
3.

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:11.430
2.

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:12.430
1.

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:14.770
The shuttle is blasting off!

00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:35.540
Hang on, Chris.

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:54.510
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:54.510
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.510 --> 00:23:03.480
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.510 --> 00:23:03.480
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:12.370
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:12.370
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:21.960
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:21.960
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:30.930
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:30.930
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:41.100
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:41.100
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:49.860
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:49.860
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:59.040
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:59.040
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:03.880
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:03.880
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:29.590 --> 00:25:35.430
Space Colony ARK Battle
